    "title": "Cikcik: Live, Share & Connect",
    "description": "LIVE STREAMS, MESSAGES & CALLS\r\n\r\nAre you ready for new friendships with millions of active users? Follow, connect, and become a part of communities with the most recognizable creators. Cikcik is a social streaming platform where you can share sections from your life by making real-time streams and one-on-one calls. Sing, talk, dance, and share a slice of your life.\r\n\r\nLive Streams\r\nJoin the most entertaining live streams from around the globe and participate in the show. Meet with new people online and improve your social circle. Follow each other, send messages and gifts, and talk to each other. Explore new communities and multiply the fun!\r\n\r\nMessages & Calls\r\nYou don\u2019t need to be shy. To improve your relationship with people, call them. Random calls are just away from the push of a button. Just tap it and open the door of the new relations. Don\u2019t worry if you do not know their language; We don\u2019t have this problem here!\r\n\r\nTranslation\r\nLanguage barrier? No problem! While you can talk, you can message each other with instant translation. It is great to get to know different cultures.\r\n\r\nFor more information, you can review our privacy policies.\r\n\r\nIn case of any problems, contact the in-app help section or support@cikcik.app",
